<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 0 Ajax Amsterdam 1 (Dani 46). Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 13,500</p>
<p>Twente Enschede 1 (Hoogma 10) PSV Eindhoven 2 (Nilis 22, Jonk</p>
<p>82). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 8,745.</p>
<p>Groningen 0 Feyenoord 1 (Vos 4). Halftime 1-0. Attendance</p>
<p>15,500.</p>
<p>Utrecht 3 (Visser 18, Robbemond 34, Mols 43) NAC Breda 1</p>
<p>(Arnold 4). Halftime 2-1. Attendance 9,000.</p>
<p>Volendam 1 (Nijholt 85) RKC Waalwijk 0. Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 3,710.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 0 Heerenveen 2 (Nygaard 29, Dahl Tomasson 85).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1. Attendance 8,200.</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 3 (Langerak 49, Sumiala 68, Janssen 76) Sparta</p>
<p>Rotterdam 2 (Dennis de Nooyer 24, Van der Laan 85). Halftime</p>
<p>0-1. Attendance 3,000.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 3 (Van der Heyden 28, Van Houdt 53, Vrede 89)</p>
<p>Graafschap Doetinchem 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance 6,600.</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 1 (Van der Weert 40) Vitesse Arnhem 5 (Curovic</p>
<p>4, Makaay 13, 20, 25, 34). Halftime 1-5. Attendance 3,500.</p>
</text>
